# The WiX 3 toolset Tauri's MSI bundler packs with: `<version> <url> <sha256>`. Tauri downloads it itself
# when its tools folder lacks it (no retry: one HTTP 500 from github.com failed the whole msi chain on
# 2026-11-18), so ci/build-msi.sh seeds the folder from here first (ci/fetch-wix.sh: retry, cache, checksum).
# The URL and hash are the ones compiled into the pinned Tauri command line (tauri-bundler's WIX_URL and
# WIX_SHA256); ci/check-wix-pin.sh fails when that binary names something else, so bump this file together
# with ci/tauri-cli.sha256.
